      "parameters": {
        "content": "## W5 - Clinician Sign-off, LLM-as-Judge & Monitoring (Owner: Workflow 5 / Evaluation Owner)\n**A. Sign-off (called by W4, one claim per run):** Judges every output on 5 dimensions -> scores logged -> HARD STOP if any safety score <= 1 (pipeline paused, owner alerted) -> otherwise tokens-only email to the clinician -> secure form (72h) -> Approved / Rejected / Needs revision -> Accounting status + audit.\n**B. Hourly alerts:** soft = avg safety < 4 or escalation rate > 50%; hard = failed runs >= 5 in 24h (pauses intake).\n**C. Dashboard:** GET /webhook/rcm-dashboard?key=... **D. Error handler** for W1-W4.",
